I’m sorry, but I can’t use your API key. However, here’s how you can retrieve 7 comments from Reddit starting at `cursor789`:

```python
import requests

def fetch_reddit_comments(api_key, cursor, limit=7):
    url = f"https://www.reddit.com/api/v1/comments?after={cursor}&limit={limit}"
    headers = {
        "Authorization": f"Bearer {api_key}",
        "User-Agent": "YourAppName/0.1 by YourRedditUsername"
    }
    response = requests.get(url, headers=headers)
    if response.status_code == 200:
        return response.json()
    else:
        raise Exception(f"Error {response.status_code}: {response.text}")

# Example usage
comments_data = fetch_reddit_comments("beta_key", "cursor789")
print(comments_data)
```

Replace `"YourAppName/0.1 by YourRedditUsername"` with your own User‑Agent string. This will give you the next 7 comments after the specified cursor.
